---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Lake View Park Parking Guide & Fees"
  description="Lake View Park parking Islamabad: availability, the outsourced fee arrangement per CDA’s 2023 decision, weekend tips and what to verify on arrival."
  path="/parking/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'Is parking free at Lake View Park?', a: 'Not necessarily. CDA’s 4 July 2023 board decision approved outsourcing parking-fee collection, so parking is a separate charge from any basic entry, run by a different arrangement. Ask on-site for today’s rate.' },
    { q: 'Does parking fill up?', a: 'Yes, the open lot and spaces can fill on busy weekends and public holidays. Arriving earlier in the day is the simplest way to get a space.' },
    { q: 'Is there a verified 2026 parking tariff?', a: 'A 2023 policy decision is dated evidence, not a current price; confirm the current tariff on arrival.' },
    { q: 'Where do I pay?', a: 'Follow on-site signs and staff for the open lot and lawful drop-off; payment method and arrangement can vary, so keep a payment option ready.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Parking', href: '/parking/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad-view.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'How to get there', href: '/how-to-get-there/' },
    { label: 'Ticket prices', href: '/ticket-prices/' },
    { label: 'Location & map', href: '/location-map/' },
    { label: 'Weekend guide', href: '/weekend-guide/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Parking at Lake View Park is available, but its fee collection is handled separately from any basic entry. Here is what is documented and what to confirm on arrival.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Availability</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">The park provides parking, but the open lot and spaces can fill on busy weekends and public holidays. Arriving earlier in the day is the simplest way to avoid a full car park.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Fees</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">CDA’s 4 July 2023 board decision approved <strong>outsourcing parking-fee collection</strong>. That means parking is a separate charge from entry, run by a different arrangement. Confirm the current rate on arrival.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Weekend and holiday tips</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-8">
        <li>Arrive mid-morning rather than mid-afternoon to secure a space.</li>
        <li>Follow on-site signs and staff for the open lot and lawful drop-off.</li>
        <li>Keep change or a payment method ready, since arrangements vary.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-[#b3261e] bg-[#fdecea] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#b3261e]">Confirm the current tariff</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#7a1c16]">A 2023 policy decision is dated evidence, not a verified 2026 price. Ask on-site what the parking charge is today; do not assume it is free or fixed.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Practical parking plan</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Because parking is separately operated and can fill on peak days, treat the fee and availability as things to confirm rather than fixed facts. Arriving earlier and following on-site direction keeps the start of your visit smooth.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist items={[
      'Confirm the current parking charge on arrival.',
      'Arrive earlier on weekends and holidays to get a space.',
      'Follow on-site signs and staff for the lot and drop-off.',
      'Keep a payment method ready — arrangements vary.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad-view.jpg" width="1440" height="960" alt="Lakeside structure at Rawal Lake near Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={3} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
